[Debug] ----- Vuln Cause Analysis -----
The potential vulnerability is related to an Open Redirect vulnerability. This vulnerability arises when the application accepts a user-supplied URL as input and redirects users to that URL without proper validation. If the code does not verify that the target URL belongs to a trusted domain, it can be exploited by attackers to redirect users to malicious sites, potentially leading to phishing attacks or other security issues. The lack of checks on the legitimacy of the target URL allows for unauthorized redirection, compromising user trust and safety.

